# MedBook / NeuroFax — recommended host crontab.
# Install with: `crontab ops/crontab.example` (on the deploy host, as the
# user that owns the repo checkout), or merge the lines into the existing
# root crontab (`crontab -l` first: neighbours on this host have theirs).
#
# The docker-compose `certbot` sidecar renews certificates; nginx picks a
# renewed one up only on reload, which the hourly line below does when the
# certbot deploy hook asked for it (audit INF-03).

MAILTO=""

# Nightly Postgres backup → MinIO, 03:15 UTC.
15 3 * * * cd /opt/neurofax && ./ops/backup.sh >> /var/log/medbook-backup.log 2>&1

# Health watchdog: /api/health (workers included) + TLS expiry, every 5 min.
*/5 * * * * cd /opt/neurofax && ./ops/watchdog.sh >> /var/log/medbook-watchdog.log 2>&1

# Reload nginx after certbot renewed a certificate (no-op otherwise).
23 * * * * cd /opt/neurofax && ./ops/nginx-reload-on-renew.sh >> /var/log/medbook-nginx-reload.log 2>&1
